   274	## 4. The exact forest cut, and why it is conditional
   275	
   276	Let `T_E` denote the connected exceptional ADE tree in a fully resolved SNC
   277	boundary.  Any actual strict divisor supplies a collection of analytic
   278	branches, and their contact vectors give one of the partitions counted by
   279	(3.3).  Thus the computed minimum is a rigorous lower bound for the number
   280	of actual branches, although the converse realization of every counted
   281	partition is not claimed.  After the additional point blowups needed to
   282	separate tangencies or branches, distinct branches have distinct final
   283	attachment edges; several branches may have shared a physical crossing and
   284	an initial infinitely-near path before that separation.
