   135	signed graph whose coordinate positions are vertices and whose simple roots
   136	are edges.  Connectedness of the Dynkin diagram forces the used coordinate
   137	graph to be connected.  Switch coordinate signs along a spanning tree so
   138	that its edge roots are differences `e_u-e_v`.
