   141	full `A_(s-1)` lattice.  The image rank is between `s-1` and `s`.  In rank
   142	`s-1`, every remaining edge is balanced and the generated lattice is exactly
   143	`A_(s-1)`.  In rank `s`, some edge is unbalanced; adjoining its sum root to
   144	the tree differences generates exactly `D_s`.  There is no third case.
